  "id": "8e73f984-1f61-4225-90c5-17c6129998b8",
  "title": "Unified Framework for Medical Image Segmentation with Uncertainty-Aware Techniques",
  "summary": "SegWithU introduces a post-hoc framework that augments a frozen segmentation backbone with a lightweight uncertainty head, modeling uncertainty as perturbation energy in a compact probe space. It achieves state-of-the-art performance across multiple benchmark datasets, demonstrating robustness and efficiency in reliability-aware medical segmentation. The other report discusses the differentiable shift-variant FBP model for cone-beam CT, highlighting its efficiency and robustness under challenging acquisition settings.",
